most ingestions do;

	Original PDF
    	│
    	▼
	Parse
    	│
    	▼
	Remove / ignore things
    	├── headers
    	├── footers
    	├── page layout
    	├── images
    	├── fonts
    	├── PDF structure
    	├── formatting
    	└── other non-content data
    	│
    	▼

hence most RAG's can't answer Q's like 'what font used' as such layout/formatting information is lost in parsing.



